en fraud detection and real-time risk assessment for financial institutions.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex items-start\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex-shrink-0 mt-1\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                  <svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" class=\\\"h-5 w-5 text-indigo-400\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\">\\n                    <path fill-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\" d=\\\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\\\" clip-rule=\\\"evenodd\\\" />\\n                  </svg>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"ml-4\\\">\\n                <h3 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold mb-1\\\">Retail</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"text-slate-400\\\">Personalized\" }} />\n  );\n}\n",
